# Money makers
Money-making methods priced at the current market.

=> /ge/calc-decanting Potion decanting — Buy potions at one dose count, decant, sell at another. (18)
=> /ge/calc-herblore Herblore — Unfinished potions plus secondaries into finished potions. (18)
=> /ge/calc-tanning Tanning — Hides into leather at a tanner. (6)
=> /ge/calc-plank Plank making — Logs into planks at a sawmill. (4)
=> /ge/calc-smithing Smelting and the blast furnace — Ore and coal into bars. (7)
=> /ge/calc-fletching Fletching — Logs into bows, and bows into strung bows. (15)
=> /ge/calc-enchanting Enchanting — Jewellery plus runes into enchanted jewellery. (3)
=> /ge/calc-tablet Magic tablets — Soft clay plus runes into teleport tablets. (6)
=> /ge/calc-spell Spell conversions — Items transmuted in the inventory, paid for in runes. (14)
=> /ge/calc-itemset Item sets — Barrows and armour sets against their component pieces. (12)
=> /ge/calc-barrows Barrows repair — Degraded barrows gear repaired and resold. (24)
=> /ge/calc-combination Combination items — Components combined into a single higher-value item. (7)
=> /ge/calc-sapling Sapling trading — Seeds grown into saplings. (18)

## Whole-catalogue calculators
=> /ge/alch High alchemy — every item, alch value against market price
=> /ge/alch?spell=low Low alchemy — the level 21 spell, 40% of the item's value
=> /ge/alch Store profit — shop shelf against market price
=> /ge/about GE tax calculator — what a sale actually pays out

Inputs are costed at the price you would pay to buy them right now, and outputs at the price you would receive selling right now, minus tax.

=> https://grandexchange.dreamstation.systems/calc This page on the web
